{"id":"658860","name":"金针菇鸡煲","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/658860/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"土鸡","amount":"半个"},{"name":"金针菇干","amount":"50g"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜丝","amount":"10g"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"土鸡半个。","img":"images/658860/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"鸡肉剁成块。","img":"images/658860/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入盐，酱油，蚝油，胡椒粉，淀粉调味。","img":"images/658860/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"搅拌均匀后放入花生油锁住水分，腌制入味半个小时。","img":"images/658860/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"金针菇干。","img":"images/658860/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用清水泡发五分钟。","img":"images/658860/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"泡好的金针菇干，再切点姜丝。","img":"images/658860/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"准备一口砂锅，锅底喷入油，撒上姜丝。","img":"images/658860/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"垫入金针菇，放一旁备用。","img":"images/658860/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"起锅热油，倒入鸡肉。","img":"images/658860/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"两面煎至焦黄。","img":"images/658860/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"炒好的鸡肉铲入砂锅。","img":"images/658860/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"加入半碗清水，烧开后转小火炖十分钟即可。","img":"images/658860/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。香味浓郁！","img":"images/658860/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：砂锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}